# Raindrop.io API token.
#   app.raindrop.io -> Settings -> Integrations -> create an app -> "test token"
#
# bootstrap.sh writes an empty copy of this to ~/.raindrop-sync/.env (mode 600).
# Fill it in there, or leave it empty and use seed-token.sh (keychain) instead:
# a non-empty .env wins over the keychain. NEVER echo this value to a terminal,
# a log, or an AI assistant transcript. A token that has been printed is a token
# that must be rotated. See SETUP.md.
RAINDROP_TOKEN=
